---
// Post 20 (Alpha) figure: tree. Inline SVG, site tokens only. Numbers come from the Python runs recorded in the post brief.
---
<figure class="atp20-tree">
  <div class="atp20-tree-scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 900 350" role="img" aria-label="The expression tree of Alpha#101 from Kakushadze: close minus open on the left, high minus low plus a small constant on the right, joined by a division.">
<text x="20" y="28" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>One signal is one small tree of operations</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Một tín hiệu là một cây phép tính nhỏ</tspan></text>
<line x1="260" y1="70" x2="140" y2="150" class="ln" />
<line x1="260" y1="70" x2="380" y2="150" class="ln" />
<line x1="140" y1="150" x2="90" y2="240" class="ln" />
<line x1="140" y1="150" x2="190" y2="240" class="ln" />
<line x1="380" y1="150" x2="320" y2="240" class="ln" />
<line x1="380" y1="150" x2="450" y2="240" class="ln" />
<line x1="320" y1="240" x2="280" y2="320" class="ln" />
<line x1="320" y1="240" x2="360" y2="320" class="ln" />
<circle cx="260" cy="70" r="19" class="node" />
<text x="260" y="75" class="mono" text-anchor="middle">÷</text>
<circle cx="140" cy="150" r="19" class="node" />
<text x="140" y="155" class="mono" text-anchor="middle">−</text>
<circle cx="380" cy="150" r="19" class="node" />
<text x="380" y="155" class="mono" text-anchor="middle">+</text>
<circle cx="320" cy="240" r="19" class="node" />
<text x="320" y="245" class="mono" text-anchor="middle">−</text>
<rect x="53" y="225" width="74" height="30" rx="6" class="leaf" />
<text x="90" y="245" class="mono" text-anchor="middle">close</text>
<rect x="153" y="225" width="74" height="30" rx="6" class="leaf" />
<text x="190" y="245" class="mono" text-anchor="middle">open</text>
<rect x="420" y="225" width="60" height="30" rx="6" class="leaf" />
<text x="450" y="245" class="mono" text-anchor="middle">.001</text>
<rect x="243" y="305" width="74" height="30" rx="6" class="leaf" />
<text x="280" y="325" class="mono" text-anchor="middle">high</text>
<rect x="323" y="305" width="74" height="30" rx="6" class="leaf" />
<text x="360" y="325" class="mono" text-anchor="middle">low</text>
<rect x="560" y="60" width="320" height="262" rx="8" class="box" />
<text x="578" y="88" class="b">Alpha#101</text>
<text x="578" y="112" class="mono">((close - open) /</text>
<text x="578" y="132" class="mono"> ((high - low) + .001))</text>
<text x="578" y="166"><tspan data-lang-en>How far the day closed from its open,</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Phiên đóng cửa cách giá mở bao xa,</tspan></text>
<text x="578" y="186"><tspan data-lang-en>as a share of the day’s range.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>tính theo bề rộng của phiên.</tspan></text>
<text x="578" y="216" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>The .001 only stops a divide by zero.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Số .001 chỉ để khỏi chia cho 0.</tspan></text>
<text x="578" y="252" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>Its author files it under delay-1</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Tác giả xếp nó vào nhóm delay-1</tspan></text>
<text x="578" y="270" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>momentum: trade tomorrow on today.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>momentum: hôm nay có số, mai mới vào lệnh.</tspan></text>
<text x="578" y="300" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>4 inputs, 3 operators, 1 constant.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>4 đầu vào, 3 phép tính, 1 hằng số.</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The tree behind a one-line formula. A search program builds and edits trees like this one, not the text.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Cây phép tính đằng sau một dòng công thức. Chương trình tìm kiếm dựng và sửa những cây như thế này, không sửa chữ.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .atp20-tree { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .atp20-tree-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .atp20-tree svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .atp20-tree text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .atp20-tree .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp20-tree .s { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp20-tree .xs { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp20-tree .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp20-tree .mono { font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp20-tree .redt { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .atp20-tree .goldt { fill: var(--gold-icon); font-weight: 700; }
  .atp20-tree .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .atp20-tree .okb { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .atp20-tree .badb { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .atp20-tree .node { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .atp20-tree .leaf { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .atp20-tree .nodeg { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 2; }
  .atp20-tree .noder { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; }
  .atp20-tree .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; }
  .atp20-tree .arrf { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp20-tree .ax { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; fill: none; }
  .atp20-tree .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; stroke-dasharray: 3 4; fill: none; }
  .atp20-tree .redl { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; fill: none; }
  .atp20-tree .goldl { stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 2; fill: none; }
  .atp20-tree .mutl { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; fill: none; }
  .atp20-tree .redf { fill: var(--red); }
  .atp20-tree .goldf { fill: var(--gold); }
  .atp20-tree .mutf { fill: var(--text-faint); }
  .atp20-tree .tick { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px; }
  .atp20-tree figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>